# Pins for blackbox-build-reranker-gguf.sh — the GGUF behind the on-box reranker
# (llama-swap member rerank-qwen3-8b, ${models-dir}/Qwen3-Reranker-8B-Q8_0.gguf).
#
# llama.cpp is NOT pinned here: the convert + quantize run at the llamacpp-version
# tag the installer builds llama-server from, so the converter and the server
# that loads its output are the same release (that tag post-dates the
# Qwen3-Reranker convert fix, llama.cpp #16407; the script checks).
#
# Three non-comment lines: <hf-repo>, <hf-revision>, <reference-sha256>.
#   hf-revision       the 40-hex commit of the HF checkpoint (main as of the
#                     2026-07-22 MS02 conversion; the repo's last change is
#                     2026-04-16).
#   reference-sha256  the Q8_0 GGUF that passed the G2 gate on MS02 (8,047,134,272
#                     bytes). It was converted at an unrecorded llama.cpp tag, so a
#                     fresh build may differ byte-wise: a match proves the artifact,
#                     a mismatch means "run the G2 gate before selecting it". It is
#                     also the checksum to pin when that artifact is published.
